  "changed_scope_explanation": [
    "round.rs changed ordinary dependency planning/restart order, Voice quiet boundaries, saved rollback order and pruning. With the required clean ordinary journal baseline, same-N returns before ordinary planning; ordinary rollback/recovery and pruning are not entered.",
    "records.rs added rollback_order journal serialization/validation and dated tests. Self-pending uses own.rs; the worksheet requires no ordinary recovery journal at entry.",
    "unit.rs re-exports the new unit/restart_order.rs parser. install.rs changed a night-sleep comment only.",
    "Product lamp-skills.service and lamp-expression.service enable night-sleep/rest switches. A same-sequence self-only round does not install those units.",
    "Updated or added updater tests and dated serialized records accompany the ordinary restart/recovery changes."
  ],
  "conclusion": "Source supports the existing same-sequence self-only candidate-exec worksheet at the current commit. Do not claim the former seven-file whole-file identity: round.rs and records.rs differ.",
  "preconditions_and_limits": [
    "Use LAMP_UPDATE_SELF=on and an applied round, with the already installed sequence N and a valid signed envelope/channel. A clean ordinary journal and self-pending baseline are required.",
    "Same-sequence equality remains after envelope/schema/channel validation and before installed-unit discovery or ordinary dependency planning; own() still runs after UpToDate when opted in.",
    "An unchanged installed sequence does not mean unchanged state.json bytes: candidate staging can add its build folder to state.made.",
    "The successful candidate exec still follows candidate staging/sync, pending persistence, and current-link replacement/sync. The observer must identify the candidate exec, not initial exec or syscall entry.",
    "No new artifact, executable, ABI, runtime dependency, observer, systemd override, device, flash, cold-boot or physical-power qualification is established.",
    "Fresh official CI and selected actual ARM64 artifact/fallback hashes remain required. Existing attended access, window, physical precautions, persistent configuration and restoration inputs remain pending.",
    "No Cargo, device access, publication or repository/source edits were performed for this receipt."
  ]
}
